"""Interval division and typed prepared window AVG: 106 exact PG18.6 controls.

Normal Simple and valid unbounded Extended execution, including four genuine
text Bind pairs with explicit interval/float8 OIDs. Every rejected SQL is still
followed by the remaining independent observations. No retained portal or
parameter ownership policy is changed.
"""
